{"5094320": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Build or be sniped", "steam_appid": 5094320, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "UP TO 30 players lobbies. One tower. One sniper. Multiple gamemodes. Build your way to the top, steal the rifle, chair or magic wand and become the player everyone else is trying to take down in a chaotic physics-based multiplayer party game.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAME MODES</h2><br><strong>TOWER RUN</strong><br>Everyone gets their own lane. Build faster than the others, survive the sniper and reach the top first.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5094320/extras/a876a7f3b09c7fe77fcd05319ca77098.poster.avif?t=1787057077\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5094320/extras/a876a7f3b09c7fe77fcd05319ca77098.webm?t=1787057077\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5094320/extras/a876a7f3b09c7fe77fcd05319ca77098.mp4?t=1787057077\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><strong>JENGA</strong><br>Protect your own jenga tower over open water while trying to shoot everyone else's apart. Stay out of the water longer than the rest.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5094320/extras/3be81839c71bdd2230d1d08011e8d75d.poster.avif?t=1787057077\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5094320/extras/3be81839c71bdd2230d1d08011e8d75d.webm?t=1787057077\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5094320/extras/3be81839c71bdd2230d1d08011e8d75d.mp4?t=1787057077\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Knife Wars</strong><br>A city full of throwable knives. Blades stick into walls, floors and other blades, letting you build ridiculous improvised staircases wherever you can land them.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5094320/extras/36adfb4fbe18692d8214b12acb5ed0e4.poster.avif?t=1787057077\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5094320/extras/36adfb4fbe18692d8214b12acb5ed0e4.webm?t=1787057077\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5094320/extras/36adfb4fbe18692d8214b12acb5ed0e4.mp4?t=1787057077\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>SNIPE OR HIDE</strong><br>One player has the rifle. Everyone else has a brick wall. The sniper slowly destroys the cover layer by layer, and one good shot is enough. After each round the tables turn - hiders become snipers.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5094320/extras/c2c2145779f7735e85905ab1b62f8859.poster.avif?t=1787057077\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5094320/extras/c2c2145779f7735e85905ab1b62f8859.webm?t=1787057077\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5094320/extras/c2c2145779f7735e85905ab1b62f8859.mp4?t=1787057077\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>CHAIR WARS</strong><br>Three lives. One chair. A very long drop.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5094320/extras/376dae24ae365a1c3bc719fa3b89591b.poster.avif?t=1787057077\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5094320/extras/376dae24ae365a1c3bc719fa3b89591b.webm?t=1787057077\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5094320/extras/376dae24ae365a1c3bc719fa3b89591b.mp4?t=1787057077\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>DRAW SPELLS</strong><br>Cast spells by actually drawing their symbols. There are loads of spells to learn, and the game judges the shape you draw rather than giving you a button to press.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5094320/extras/2b3ee4d94044691c2031a3ff654b37ff.poster.avif?t=1787057077\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5094320/extras/2b3ee4d94044691c2031a3ff654b37ff.webm?t=1787057077\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5094320/extras/2b3ee4d94044691c2031a3ff654b37ff.mp4?t=1787057077\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>AND MUCH MORE</strong><br>- We won't spoil that though :)<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ENJOY THE CHAOS</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5094320/extras/84b07f90a550a18cfd4546d526bfa3dc.poster.avif?t=1787057077\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5094320/extras/84b07f90a550a18cfd4546d526bfa3dc.webm?t=1787057077\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5094320/extras/84b07f90a550a18cfd4546d526bfa3dc.mp4?t=1787057077\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span c